# CR 510.4, PhaseHandler.java:321-332: with no first or double striker in
# combat, the first-strike damage step deals no damage and grants no
# priority. After Declare Blockers (Upkeep, Main1, BeginCombat, Declare
# Attackers, Declare Blockers: five steps, turn 1 skips its draw), human
# queues a mana ability; stepping into First Strike Damage never asks for
# it, so the Mountain stays untapped and ai takes no damage yet.
startturn human
queue attackers 1
queue attacktarget ai
step 5
queue action human tapformana 2 R
step
